			<Item class="Script" referent="RBX1132">
				<Properties>
					<bool name="Disabled">false</bool>
					<Content name="LinkedSource"><null></null></Content>
					<string name="Name">Instruction&apos;s</string>
					<ProtectedString name="Source">--[[
Change the Model name to the Tool/HopperBin name and the Cost of the Tool/HopperBin Ex: MachineGun: -1234
 
1.Put the tool you want to use in the Lighting.


2.Change the Cost of the tool if you want.


3. At the top,Find this line:findFirstChild(&quot;Bow of Accuracy&quot;) Change the Item in &quot; &apos;s to whatever your Tool name is.</ProtectedString>
				</Properties>
			</Item>
		</Item>
		<Item class="Script" referent="RBX1133">
			<Properties>
				<bool name="Disabled">false</bool>
				<Content name="LinkedSource"><null></null></Content>
				<string name="Name">Cash badge script</string>
				<ProtectedString name="Source">local BadgeID = 49839764 -- the badge id
local Cash = &quot;KOs&quot; -- your tycoon currency of money
local HowMuch = 200 -- amount of cash
game.Players.PlayerAdded:connect(function(p) -- leave the rest
repeat wait() until p:findFirstChild(&quot;leaderstats&quot;) ~= nil 
p.leaderstats[KOs].Changed:connect(function() 
if p.leaderstats[KOs].Value &lt;= HowMuch - 1 then return end 
game:GetService(&quot;BadgeService&quot;):AwardBadge(p.userId, BadgeID) 
end) 
end) 

-- Fully functional!</ProtectedString>
			</Properties>
		</Item>
