					<ProtectedString name="Source">--[[
Change the Model name to the Tool/HopperBin name and the Cost of the Tool/HopperBin Ex: MachineGun: -1234
 
1.Put the tool you want to use in the Lighting.


2.Change the Cost of the tool if you want.


3. At the top,Find this line:findFirstChild(&quot;Bow of Accuracy&quot;) Change the Item in &quot; &apos;s to whatever your Tool name is.</ProtectedString>
				</Properties>
			</Item>
