								<ProtectedString name="Source">-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
model = script.Parent.Parent.Parent.rsg   --This is the WHATEVER. you made a desk in the instructions SO name the part called MODELNAME to &quot;Desk&quot;. Then change price to what you want. Type it in next to the last dot.
