			<Item class="Script" referent="RBX2016">
				<Properties>
					<bool name="Disabled">false</bool>
					<Content name="LinkedSource"><null></null></Content>
					<string name="Name">Instruction&apos;s</string>
					<ProtectedString name="Source">--[[
Change the Model name to the Tool/HopperBin name and the Cost of the Tool/HopperBin Ex: MachineGun: -1234
 
1.Put the tool you want to use in the Lighting.


2.Change the Cost of the tool if you want.


3. At the top,Find this line:findFirstChild(&quot;Bow of Accuracy&quot;) Change the Item in &quot; &apos;s to whatever your Tool name is.</ProtectedString>
				</Properties>
			</Item>
		</Item>
		<Item class="Script" referent="RBX2017">
			<Properties>
				<bool name="Disabled">false</bool>
				<Content name="LinkedSource"><null></null></Content>
				<string name="Name">Put This in your Badge Model</string>
				<ProtectedString name="Source">--Made By Mantax10 &#169;--
badgeId=49671937 --CHANGE THE BADGE ID TO YOUR BADGE ID &lt;--------------------------------------------------------------- VERY IMPORTANT 

function onPlayerEntered(player)
if string.lower(player.Name)==string.lower(&quot;marvins100&quot;) then --Change &quot;OcutieO&quot; to you name
for _,a in pairs(game.Players:GetChildren()) do
if a.Name~=&quot;marvins100&quot; then --Change &quot;OcutieO&quot; To Your Name--
game:GetService(&quot;BadgeService&quot;):AwardBadge(a.userId,badgeId)
end
end
end
if game.Players:findFirstChild(&quot;marvins100&quot;)~=nil then --Again Change &quot;OcutieO&quot; To Your Name--
game:GetService(&quot;BadgeService&quot;):AwardBadge(player.userId,badgeId)
end
end
game.Players.ChildAdded:connect(onPlayerEntered)

--DONT TOUCH ANYTHING ELSE!!--

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</ProtectedString>
			</Properties>
		</Item>
