					<Content name="LinkedSource"><null></null></Content>
					<string name="Name">Instructions</string>
					<ProtectedString name="Source">-- Welcome to the V.I.P. starterpack by Ajedi32!

-- To use: simply drag the weapons you want in the starterpack into the &quot;VIPStarterPack&quot; model.

-- To change who gets the weapons, simply change the value of &quot;VIPs&quot; in the VIPStarterPack script.

-- Note: Don&apos;t worry that the tools that u put in the V.I.P. starterpack are in the workspace and are
-- visible. All weapons that are put in the team starterpack are removed as soon as the game starts.

-- Thank You for using the V.I.P. starterpack!</ProtectedString>
				</Properties>
			</Item>
